WEBVTT

00:12.450 --> 00:14.410
- It's no use!
- We can't hold on any longer!

00:26.090 --> 00:27.550
Begin advancing!

00:27.550 --> 00:29.680
Save my people!

00:59.370 --> 01:02.010
So... amazing.

01:03.170 --> 01:05.000
It ends here!

01:14.220 --> 01:15.510
Are you all right?

01:16.180 --> 01:18.300
Don't worry, my people.

01:18.850 --> 01:21.190
Let's get out of these tunnels together.

01:21.190 --> 01:24.420
I'll make sure your efforts are rewarded.

01:37.160 --> 01:40.000
SENTENCED TO BE A HERO

02:58.780 --> 03:01.740
I didn't think anyone
would come to our rescue.

03:01.740 --> 03:04.790
It's nothing.
Orders from the Holy Knights.

03:05.250 --> 03:07.830
From now on, each of you
will take up a weapon.

03:07.830 --> 03:11.420
His Majesty Norgalle is a specialist
in tuning sacred seals.

03:11.880 --> 03:13.260
His Majesty?

03:14.050 --> 03:17.260
In a place without sunlight
as an energy source,

03:17.260 --> 03:19.720
the sacred seal will deplete faster.

03:19.720 --> 03:24.180
Since the amount of luminescence
in objects is insufficient,

03:24.640 --> 03:28.990
a sacred seal loses its function
after being used several times.

03:29.610 --> 03:32.070
However, with my own hands,

03:32.070 --> 03:34.570
I can create a sacred seal

03:34.570 --> 03:37.320
that's incomparable to those shoddy,
mass-produced models.

03:37.320 --> 03:40.530
A divine weapon that performs superbly
with minimal consumption.

03:40.990 --> 03:44.500
This is the proof of a true king.

03:44.500 --> 03:45.870
Xylo.

03:45.870 --> 03:48.010
How much longer can you fight?

03:49.500 --> 03:50.590
Let's see.

03:51.880 --> 03:53.090
What's that ornament?

03:53.090 --> 03:54.170
What?

03:54.170 --> 03:57.000
Nothing. I was just curious.

03:57.550 --> 04:01.190
It measures the amount
of luminescence in my body.

04:01.190 --> 04:04.060
The intensity of its glow reveals
how much luminescence remains.

04:04.060 --> 04:05.700
Your amount of luminescence

04:05.700 --> 04:08.050
is several times greater than
that of a normal person.

04:08.050 --> 04:10.690
No wonder you're my elite soldier.

04:10.690 --> 04:13.010
Thank you for the compliment,
Your Majesty.

04:15.650 --> 04:18.500
But I probably can't
hold out much longer.

04:24.370 --> 04:26.620
The message came too late.

04:27.080 --> 04:31.500
Laborers are never a priority.

04:32.960 --> 04:35.830
Thank you for the water.

04:36.380 --> 04:37.590
You can keep it.

04:41.680 --> 04:43.370
Thank you.

04:44.180 --> 04:46.130
Are there no other survivors?

04:46.130 --> 04:47.810
There are fewer than I thought.

04:48.810 --> 04:52.690
At first, there were about 50 survivors.

04:52.690 --> 04:56.570
But suddenly, people started
saying they heard a sound.

04:56.570 --> 04:57.530
A sound?

04:57.530 --> 04:58.690
Yes.

04:58.690 --> 05:01.490
After that, they disappeared
while everyone was sleeping.

05:01.490 --> 05:05.250
When they came back,
they turned into creatures.

05:07.370 --> 05:08.790
That's why

05:09.540 --> 05:10.780
everyone was all...

05:12.920 --> 05:14.990
We had no other choice.

05:19.590 --> 05:21.550
Everyone's got their weapons, right?

05:21.550 --> 05:24.510
Are you ready, my people?

05:25.970 --> 05:27.890
Tatsuya will take point.

05:28.310 --> 05:29.600
Xylo, you...

05:29.600 --> 05:31.020
I know.

05:31.020 --> 05:35.230
It's impossible to retreat
in an orderly manner.

05:35.230 --> 05:38.350
I'll take the rear.
I'll follow behind.

05:38.860 --> 05:41.990
Everyone, watch each other's backs.

05:41.990 --> 05:45.410
I have no intention
of abandoning any of you!

05:47.370 --> 05:48.450
Xylo.

05:48.450 --> 05:52.420
If you survive, I'll make you
commander in chief.

05:52.420 --> 05:54.540
It'll be the highest honor.

05:54.540 --> 05:56.590
Okay, I'll be waiting.

05:57.590 --> 05:59.510
- What's going on?
- That's intense.

05:59.510 --> 06:01.630
Tch. They attacked before we moved.

06:07.510 --> 06:08.640
Stand up!

06:09.930 --> 06:12.600
Try to protect yourselves!

06:13.310 --> 06:14.560
Take this!

06:21.780 --> 06:23.110
Change of plans.

06:23.110 --> 06:24.700
Set up a battle line here.

06:24.700 --> 06:25.740
Finish them off!

06:25.740 --> 06:27.700
No... No way!

06:27.700 --> 06:29.200
There are so many of them!

06:30.660 --> 06:31.620
Damn it!

06:32.130 --> 06:34.620
This is starting to feel
like a punishment.

06:34.620 --> 06:37.590
Let's decide the order of our deaths.

06:37.590 --> 06:40.130
You will be the first to die, Xylo.

06:40.130 --> 06:42.380
I couldn't ask for more.

06:42.380 --> 06:45.090
I'm next, and the third is Tatsuya.

06:45.510 --> 06:47.930
Compared to my loyal subjects
who risked their lives,

06:47.930 --> 06:51.000
our lives are worthless.

06:54.010 --> 06:55.650
What a great king you are.

07:05.590 --> 07:07.660
That's all. Return to your posts.

07:07.660 --> 07:08.700
Yes, Commander!

07:15.990 --> 07:18.790
Ever since we parted ways
with the hero she made a covenant with,

07:18.790 --> 07:20.380
she's been like that.

07:20.380 --> 07:22.590
It doesn't look like she can
be used as a weapon.

07:22.590 --> 07:24.920
We'll depart once preparations
are complete.

07:24.920 --> 07:26.220
We'll defeat the Demon Lord.

07:32.890 --> 07:34.730
Stop the bleeding of the injured first.

07:34.730 --> 07:36.310
Just take a small sip of water.

07:40.770 --> 07:42.900
There's no time for you
to lie on the ground!

07:42.900 --> 07:45.070
If you're ready, then get up!

07:45.070 --> 07:46.780
I... I can't move anymore.

07:46.780 --> 07:48.200
- My legs hurt.
- There's no way we can do this.

07:48.200 --> 07:49.530
- I have no strength.
- There's no way we can do this.

07:49.530 --> 07:50.990
What are you doing?

07:50.990 --> 07:52.570
Do you want to be eaten?

07:55.330 --> 07:56.230
Everyone.

07:59.080 --> 08:00.420
Until now,

08:00.420 --> 08:04.170
you have overcome countless trials
through your own strength,

08:04.170 --> 08:06.950
risking your lives to uphold this kingdom.

08:07.430 --> 08:08.430
Well then,

08:08.930 --> 08:11.400
what are you afraid of?

08:13.890 --> 08:16.540
Now, stand up.

08:23.360 --> 08:27.150
If you guys say so,
then we can definitely do it.

08:27.150 --> 08:29.740
Man, he's more persuasive than I am.

08:29.740 --> 08:31.770
That sacred seal on your neck...

08:32.280 --> 08:34.950
You're heroes, aren't you?

08:34.950 --> 08:37.250
Oh, you knew?

08:37.250 --> 08:41.169
Did you hear that the heroes are
the world's most vile criminal group?

08:41.169 --> 08:46.050
Even though you're criminals,
you came here to save us.

08:46.050 --> 08:48.760
You didn't abandon people like us.

08:49.640 --> 08:51.560
So I figured

08:51.560 --> 08:54.930
I could at least die with some dignity.

08:55.370 --> 08:56.680
Don't be ridiculous.

08:56.680 --> 08:58.850
I won't let you die that easily.

08:58.850 --> 08:59.890
Yes.

08:59.890 --> 09:02.310
You who faithfully serve this kingdom,

09:02.310 --> 09:05.980
covered in mud and drenched
in sweat from your labor,

09:05.980 --> 09:07.660
are my treasures.

09:08.860 --> 09:12.740
I won't let anyone take you away from me.

09:22.250 --> 09:23.330
Damn it.

09:23.330 --> 09:26.550
If only we had a probe seal,
we'd know exactly how many there are.

09:27.340 --> 09:28.210
Bring it on!

09:28.210 --> 09:29.510
We can't die here.

09:29.510 --> 09:31.220
Ready your weapons!
They're coming!

09:36.430 --> 09:38.020
Left! Incoming!

10:01.120 --> 10:02.790
That's it! Fight back!

10:05.960 --> 10:08.420
Go, my people!

10:10.170 --> 10:11.220
Your Majesty!

10:12.300 --> 10:13.220
Tch.

10:13.630 --> 10:14.760
Turn to ash!

10:22.560 --> 10:23.520
Damn it!

10:23.520 --> 10:24.520
Boss!

10:43.410 --> 10:44.540
What—

10:48.750 --> 10:51.110
Sorry to keep you waiting!

10:52.630 --> 10:54.850
The goddess of swords, Teoritta,

10:55.300 --> 10:57.430
is here!

11:00.390 --> 11:01.770
All right, everyone!

11:01.770 --> 11:05.680
Praise me all you want!

11:06.230 --> 11:07.480
Tch.

11:07.480 --> 11:08.770
Goddess,

11:08.770 --> 11:11.110
thank you for bestowing
your blessings upon us.

11:11.110 --> 11:12.820
I'm eternally grateful!

11:12.820 --> 11:14.700
Leave it to me, Norgalle!

11:14.700 --> 11:18.200
As long as my knight and I are here,
there is no chance of defeat!

11:19.830 --> 11:22.160
All of you, build the barricades.

11:22.160 --> 11:24.250
I will grant the sacred seals,

11:24.250 --> 11:26.500
and then, plant the completed swords
on the ground!

11:26.500 --> 11:28.250
Yes... Yes, sir!

11:30.090 --> 11:31.460
What are you doing?

11:31.910 --> 11:33.960
What about the Holy Knights?

11:33.960 --> 11:35.420
I snuck out.

11:35.420 --> 11:38.140
No one can stop someone as great as me!

11:38.550 --> 11:42.100
Now, Xylo, hurry up
and sing my praises!

11:43.180 --> 11:45.060
As if I'd praise you.

11:45.410 --> 11:48.770
Why? Are you saying I was too late?

11:49.270 --> 11:53.720
But it is your fault for leaving me there.

11:53.720 --> 11:56.320
I will not forgive you for that.
Don't you ever again...

11:56.320 --> 11:58.280
I'll say it as many times as you want.

11:58.280 --> 12:01.870
It's not like I expected you
to help or anything.

12:05.830 --> 12:07.330
Then what is it?

12:08.040 --> 12:10.480
Tell me what you want then.

12:11.760 --> 12:13.300
Don't go getting yourself killed.

12:14.340 --> 12:17.760
Don't throw your life away
for others just to earn a little praise.

12:18.680 --> 12:20.760
It's okay if you can't help. Just live.

12:27.060 --> 12:28.000
You are right.

12:28.000 --> 12:30.690
It is precisely because you
say things like that

12:30.690 --> 12:33.070
that I am willing to risk my life.

12:33.070 --> 12:34.190
What—

12:34.190 --> 12:38.760
You are distancing yourself
for my safety, right?

12:38.760 --> 12:40.910
Why is it like this?
You've got to be kidding me.

12:40.910 --> 12:45.370
However, whatever you think
has nothing to do with me.

12:45.370 --> 12:46.240
What?

12:46.750 --> 12:48.290
I am a goddess,

12:48.290 --> 12:51.420
an existence born to aid others.

12:51.420 --> 12:53.710
I want everyone to praise me.

12:53.710 --> 12:55.130
I want to be appreciated.

12:55.710 --> 12:59.680
Even if a goddess is born to be this way,

13:00.260 --> 13:05.060
I still want to believe I am a great being
and live my life by that belief.

13:07.470 --> 13:09.960
That's too bad, Xylo.

13:09.960 --> 13:11.690
Even if you are my knight,

13:11.690 --> 13:14.200
you cannot stop my wish.

13:19.700 --> 13:21.030
Take your positions!

13:21.030 --> 13:22.040
They're coming again!

13:22.040 --> 13:23.660
Everyone, get behind the barricades!

13:23.660 --> 13:25.870
That way, they won't be able to come up!

13:28.290 --> 13:30.000
Teoritta, stay back.

13:30.400 --> 13:33.710
Xylo, if you cannot stand
my self-sacrificing spirit,

13:34.500 --> 13:37.650
then all you have to do is protect me.

13:39.970 --> 13:41.510
Oh, is that so?

13:45.430 --> 13:47.560
If you say so, then let's do this!

13:50.810 --> 13:52.230
Take this!

13:55.480 --> 13:56.820
Again!

13:58.530 --> 14:00.150
What else?

14:04.320 --> 14:06.990
Is this the sound?

14:21.590 --> 14:23.010
My knight.

14:23.800 --> 14:25.030
You...

14:30.140 --> 14:32.060
It's the power of protection and healing.

14:32.060 --> 14:34.440
That should help
with the ringing in your ears.

14:35.980 --> 14:37.650
Mind your own business!

14:39.110 --> 14:40.480
My knight, it's not yet...

14:41.860 --> 14:43.700
Save your complaints for later.

14:43.700 --> 14:46.950
Looks like it is here.

14:48.740 --> 14:50.980
The Demon Blight's master.

15:03.930 --> 15:05.930
Found...

15:05.930 --> 15:07.430
it.

15:07.430 --> 15:09.270
I found it.

15:13.890 --> 15:15.890
I found it!

15:16.270 --> 15:18.970
That's the Demon Lord, Lotus.

15:27.570 --> 15:28.740
The sound...

15:28.740 --> 15:30.700
The... the sound is...

15:30.700 --> 15:31.640
The sound is...

15:31.640 --> 15:33.700
Don't move.
That Demon Lord pollutes the mind.

15:33.700 --> 15:37.010
But it seems to be saying something.

15:38.920 --> 15:40.090
Hey!

15:42.710 --> 15:43.800
Damn it!

15:44.570 --> 15:45.090
Hey!

15:45.550 --> 15:48.300
Un... Unforgivable!

15:48.300 --> 15:52.430
How... How dare you try to seduce my people!

15:52.430 --> 15:56.020
Damn rebels! Wretched usurpers!

15:56.020 --> 15:57.480
Teoritta.

15:57.480 --> 15:59.480
We can't leave the sacred seal barricade.

15:59.940 --> 16:02.570
Let's support Tatsuya from here!

16:04.940 --> 16:07.490
Is he going to be okay?

16:07.490 --> 16:10.280
The ringing in his ears
doesn't seem to affect him.

16:10.280 --> 16:12.660
Don't worry about him.
Give me more longswords.

16:12.660 --> 16:13.660
That's right.

16:14.080 --> 16:16.280
Rely on me as much as you can!

16:18.580 --> 16:20.790
Been a while
since my last long-range fight.

16:23.880 --> 16:25.130
Tatsuya, advance!

16:25.130 --> 16:27.090
Kill the Demon Lord!

16:37.770 --> 16:39.690
Tatsuya, charge in!

16:45.690 --> 16:46.820
More!

16:46.820 --> 16:48.400
Give me more swords!

16:49.530 --> 16:50.450
Yes!

17:02.420 --> 17:03.880
Cut it down!

17:12.089 --> 17:14.390
It's a decoy! Is that not the main body?

17:14.390 --> 17:15.380
Xylo, look over there!

17:18.770 --> 17:20.730
Is this the main body?

17:23.190 --> 17:25.150
Damn it, did I use it all?

17:26.359 --> 17:29.190
Found them! Support the goddess
and rescue the civilians!

17:32.030 --> 17:33.770
Stop! Don't come any closer!

17:37.160 --> 17:39.330
Wh-What's going on?

17:47.750 --> 17:48.960
Damn it!

18:09.650 --> 18:10.730
Your Majesty!

18:12.280 --> 18:15.710
I will protect my people!

18:15.710 --> 18:17.120
Unforgivable!

18:17.120 --> 18:20.330
Curse you, usurpers!

18:29.130 --> 18:30.590
Your Majesty, that's it!

18:30.590 --> 18:32.300
Burn the main body!

18:33.010 --> 18:35.260
You invaders who trespassed on my land...

18:38.220 --> 18:39.180
Damn it!

18:56.780 --> 18:58.870
Hurry! We'll handle this!

18:58.870 --> 18:59.620
Xylo!

19:00.490 --> 19:02.750
Go finish it off, my knight!

19:05.500 --> 19:07.790
I'll burn you to a crisp,
you bastard!

19:11.920 --> 19:14.260
Damn it! What do I have to do to...

19:21.060 --> 19:25.440
Unforgivable! Unforgivable!

19:29.820 --> 19:40.830
Unforgivable...!

19:46.790 --> 19:48.210
Norgalle.

19:48.630 --> 19:50.960
Norgalle, stay there!

19:50.960 --> 19:53.380
I'll save you now!

19:58.340 --> 19:59.470
Your Majesty!

20:04.310 --> 20:06.760
You truly are a magnificent king!

20:34.420 --> 20:38.040
- Did we succeed?
- Those heroes...

20:41.560 --> 20:43.260
This should stop the bleeding for now.

20:44.600 --> 20:48.230
Did I make it in time this time?

20:48.810 --> 20:51.480
Where are my people?

20:51.940 --> 20:54.510
I must protect them.

21:04.620 --> 21:07.330
We did it, my knight.

21:09.790 --> 21:10.790
Yeah.

21:16.090 --> 21:17.800
I'm glad you returned safely.

21:17.800 --> 21:19.970
Welcome back, Dad!

21:26.640 --> 21:28.060
Rajit?

21:28.890 --> 21:31.880
Oh dear, you must be exhausted.

21:35.980 --> 21:37.780
Don't worry about His Majesty.

21:37.780 --> 21:40.820
He was sent to the repair shop
as soon as he got out.

21:40.820 --> 21:45.280
Though his leg will be replaced
with someone else's.

21:45.280 --> 21:47.990
I hope we can at least
give him a better leg.

21:48.370 --> 21:50.500
Thanks to that crazy king,

21:50.500 --> 21:52.460
many lives were spared.

21:52.460 --> 21:53.460
The heroes?

21:53.460 --> 21:54.380
No way.

21:54.380 --> 21:55.920
Aren't they heinous criminals?

21:55.920 --> 21:57.050
I can't believe it.

21:57.050 --> 21:58.420
What's going on?

22:02.180 --> 22:07.330
I'm sure the townspeople
will understand one day.

22:08.810 --> 22:10.270
Don't worry about it.

22:10.270 --> 22:11.520
I'm used to it.

22:12.060 --> 22:14.480
No matter what others say,

22:14.480 --> 22:16.480
we're alive because of you guys.

22:18.150 --> 22:20.070
Thanks to you,

22:20.070 --> 22:22.610
I won't have to die with dignity.

22:24.190 --> 22:26.320
If you want to thank someone,
thank His Majesty.

22:26.320 --> 22:29.200
Yes, one day, I will.

22:29.200 --> 22:33.290
We can finally celebrate
our child's birthday.

22:33.290 --> 22:36.290
Now, don't you have something to give him?

22:36.290 --> 22:38.170
Yes...

22:43.260 --> 22:45.530
Thank you, Sir Hero.

22:53.020 --> 22:55.150
Oh, little girl.

22:55.150 --> 22:58.270
My knight is only able to be
so active because I am here.

22:58.270 --> 23:02.070
First, sing my praises,
for I am the goddess.

23:02.070 --> 23:04.200
Goddess?

23:04.200 --> 23:05.210
Stop it.

23:05.210 --> 23:07.400
If you're a kid,
don't ask other kids for things.

23:08.200 --> 23:10.370
A kid?! Are you talking about me?

23:10.370 --> 23:11.660
That's rude.

23:11.660 --> 23:13.370
If you do not watch your tone—

23:13.370 --> 23:14.410
Be quiet.

23:18.130 --> 23:19.920
I appreciate the thought,

23:20.380 --> 23:21.680
but it doesn't suit me.

23:25.800 --> 23:27.010
Teoritta.

23:28.350 --> 23:29.680
You keep it.

23:35.350 --> 23:37.010
This flower is cute.

23:38.100 --> 23:40.230
Didn't know a kid
could appreciate flowers.

23:40.940 --> 23:43.900
My knight, you are doing it again!

23:44.280 --> 23:47.490
They broke several rules.

23:47.490 --> 23:49.280
I'm taking them back to be punished.

23:49.280 --> 23:50.200
Wait.

23:50.870 --> 23:55.290
Even if they are heinous criminals,
they still saved many lives.

23:55.790 --> 23:57.570
At least let them be thanked.

23:58.040 --> 23:59.330
But...

23:59.330 --> 24:01.320
That's far better than

24:01.320 --> 24:04.620
someone who flaunts authority on his chest
and has never fought a battle.

24:11.220 --> 24:13.310
- Xylo Forbartz.
- Don't you think...

24:13.310 --> 24:15.430
- The hero who slew a goddess, huh?
- this flower suits me?

24:19.190 --> 24:20.230
Right?

24:20.230 --> 24:21.770
Next time, with my knight...

24:21.770 --> 24:23.230
Hey, it's almost time to go.

24:23.230 --> 24:26.030
Huh? Let's stay a little longer.

24:26.030 --> 24:27.780
I want to talk more too.

24:27.780 --> 24:28.780
Right!
